# Lifted Index (°C) — negative = unstable. Transparent for stable air
# (>= +2); nearest-color clamps anything above the last stop to it.
nv    0   0   0   0
-14   130 0   150 255
-10   180 20  90  255
-8    220 40  40  255
-6    240 100 40  255
-4    240 160 50  230
-2    240 210 100 190
0     230 230 160 130
2     0   0   0   0
